The scenarios are not mutually exclusive in time: a policy-supported stabilisation can precede either of the other two.

## Limitations

GDP and history are current revised vintages, not first prints. Release dates for history are recorded only where an official calendar confirms them; otherwise availability is taken as our retrieval time. Two diagnostics (government fund revenue, exports to the US) have no public route and are absent. The China 10-year yield has no redistributable public source and is not in this build; its licensed source (Wind) is used only in the researcher's local private research mode, and nothing derived from it is published. Policy events are curated by hand from official sources and are context only.
